1992-07-01T00:00:00    27       1992-07-01T00:00:07    Bulletin C 12
1993-07-01T00:00:00    28       1993-07-01T00:00:08    Bulletin C 13
1994-07-01T00:00:00    29       1994-07-01T00:00:09    Bulletin C 14
1996-01-01T00:00:00    30       1996-01-01T00:00:10    Bulletin C 15
1997-07-01T00:00:00    31       1997-07-01T00:00:11    Bulletin C 16
1999-01-01T00:00:00    32       1999-01-01T00:00:12    Bulletin C 17
